<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>“Participant in the Travel Consumer Restitution Fund” is a registered seller of travel with its principal place of business in California, who does business with persons located in California, or is a registered seller of travel that does business in California, from one or more locations in California, and that meets the requirements of paragraph (16) of subdivision (e) of Section 17511.1.</p></caml:Content>